        "abstract": "A new design for an on-chip ionizing radiation sensor is presented. The circuit consists of two source-coupled Field Oxide Transistors biased with the same drain current through a feedback loop, whose offset in the gate voltage is amplified. This paper explains the design criteria for integration of the sensor in a 0.5 μm CMOS process. The design was validated with simulations and showed the expected behavior.",
